Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:11:15 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add Guest Flights page for engagement and wedding arrivals

- /samay/guest-flights: add each guest's flight number, landing day and time,
  route, who's picking them up and notes
- Shows whether each flight is scheduled, waiting for a spot, on the matrix
  board (with live progress and ETA) or landed
- Matrix board switch and Pin now button per flight
- Linked from the private menu and the Family & contacts page

